  "notes": "A formal and somewhat literary verb. Carries a sense of dignity and completeness in fulfilling one's purpose.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {責任|せきにん}を{全|まっと}うする (fulfill one's responsibility)\n- {役割|やくわり}を{全|まっと}うする (carry out one's role)\n- {使命|しめい}を{全|まっと}うする (accomplish one's mission)\n- {天寿|てんじゅ}を{全|まっと}うする (live out one's natural lifespan)\n- {任期|にんき}を{全|まっと}うする (serve out one's term)\n\nAlso written as {全|まっと}うする or まっとうする. The kanji {全|まっと} is read まっとう here, not ぜん.",
